## 5. Proposed Relational Structure

This is a starting design, not yet the final schema.

Likely entities:

- Student
- Project
- Faculty
- Department
- ProjectType
- Domain
- Tag
- Technology

Likely relationship tables:

- ProjectStudent
- ProjectTag
- ProjectTechnology

Possible additional entities may be introduced after ER modeling and normalization.

Conceptually:

Student
  |
  | participates in
  v
Project
  |------ belongs to ------> Domain
  |------ has -------------> ProjectType
  |------ belongs to -------> Department
  |------ mentored by ------> Faculty
  |
  | M:N
  +------ ProjectTag ------> Tag
  |
  | M:N
  +------ ProjectTechnology -> Technology

The final ER diagram must be designed before implementation.

