## 7. User Interface

A simple web application is required/strongly recommended because students need an interface through which they can search and inspect the database.

However, the UI should remain thin.

### Student interface
Main screen:
- Search bar
- Filters
- Search results
- Project detail page
- Related projects

### Admin interface
- Project management
- Student/faculty management
- Tag/domain/technology management
- Reports
- Basic statistics

A visually impressive dashboard is NOT the primary objective.

