## 12. Example End-to-End Scenario

A new student has an idea:

"Detect electricity theft using IoT."

The student:
1. Opens the repository.
2. Searches `electricity theft IoT`.
3. Applies filters if required.
4. Gets existing projects.
5. Opens project details.
6. Sees tags, domain, year, team, faculty, and technologies.
7. Reviews related projects based on shared stored attributes.
8. Uses the information to determine whether their proposed idea is sufficiently different.

If the student proceeds with a project, an authorized faculty/admin user can add it to the repository.

