## 15. Definition of Success

The project should allow a student to answer:

> "Has our college already done something similar to my project idea?"

using a structured relational database.

At the same time, the team should be able to demonstrate:

> "Here is our ER model, here is how we normalized it, here are our relationships and constraints, here are our SQL queries, here is our indexing optimization, here are our transactions/triggers/procedures, and here is how the application uses the database."

That is the core identity of the project.

